==Notes==
*Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
*The [[piercing damage]] inflicted by a ''seeker arrow'' is double the sum of weapon base damage ([[d6]] for a [[shortbow]] or d8 for a [[longbow]]), [[strength]] [[modifier]], [[weapon specialization]] (if applicable), and [[epic weapon specialization]] (if applicable). So if an arcane archer with a 12 strength and the appropriate weapon specialization rolls a 4 for damage, the piercing damage will be 2&nbsp;&times; (4 + 1 + 2) = 14 damage.
* The damage penetrates [[damage reduction]] according to the arcane archer's [[enchant arrow]] bonus.
*A seeker arrow also deals [[magical damage]] equal to the arcane archer's ''enchant arrow'' bonus.

===Previous versions===
* Prior to [[patch]] 1.87.8193.35 ([[Neverwinter Nights Enhanced Edition]]), damage reduction was not penetrated, due to a bug in the engine (not the script).
*Prior to version 1.69, this feat did not account for ''epic weapon specialization''.

